SYSTEM LibraryPlatform
GROUP PublicAPI
GROUP DataLayer
GROUP BackgroundJobs

COMPONENT ReaderAPI TYPE SERVICE
    GROUP PublicAPI
    STATE RUNNING
    CRITICALITY HIGH
END

COMPONENT CatalogDB TYPE DATABASE
    GROUP DataLayer
    STATE RUNNING
    CRITICALITY CRITICAL
END

COMPONENT CatalogReplica TYPE BACKUP
    GROUP DataLayer
    STATE STANDBY
    CRITICALITY HIGH
END

COMPONENT SearchCache TYPE CACHE
    GROUP DataLayer
    STATE RUNNING
    CRITICALITY MEDIUM
END

COMPONENT IndexWorker TYPE WORKER
    GROUP BackgroundJobs
    STATE RUNNING
    CRITICALITY MEDIUM
END

DEPENDS ReaderAPI ON CatalogDB
OPTIONAL ReaderAPI ON SearchCache
DEPENDS IndexWorker ON CatalogDB
CONNECTS ReaderAPI TO IndexWorker

RECOVERY CatalogDB
    USE CatalogReplica
    REDIRECT ReaderAPI TO CatalogReplica
END

SCENARIO CatalogDatabaseFailure
    FAIL CatalogDB
END

SCENARIO DatabaseAndCacheFailure
    FAIL CatalogDB
    FAIL SearchCache
END
